---
layout: base.njk
title: Acme Ride Support
titleSuffix: ""
description: "Help for Acme Ride: pairing sensors, loading routes, customizing the dashboard, and how the app uses your Health and location data."
---
<header class="support-intro">
  <p class="back"><a href="{{ app.url }}">&larr; {{ app.company }} {{ app.name }}</a></p>
  <h1>{{ app.name }} Support</h1>
  <p class="lead">Guides for setting up Acme Ride, riding with it, and understanding what it does with your data.</p>
</header>

{% for category in supportCategories %}
<section class="app-section">
  <h2>{{ category }}</h2>
  <ul class="features">
    {%- for article in collections.rideSupport %}
      {%- if article.data.category == category %}
    <li>
      <h3><a href="{{ article.url }}">{{ article.data.title }}</a></h3>
      <p>{{ article.data.description }}</p>
    </li>
      {%- endif %}
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
{% endfor %}

<p class="app-privacy">
  Can&rsquo;t find what you need? Email <a href="mailto:{{ site.author.email }}">{{ site.author.email }}</a>.
  See also the <a href="{{ app.url }}privacy/">{{ app.name }} Privacy Policy</a>.
</p>
